      "x": 0,
      "y": 48,
      "width": 1280,
      "height": 62,
      "text": "3 models (GPT 6.1 Sol, Sonnet 5.5, Gemini 4 Argon) x Arms A/B/C x 2 trajectories = 18 runs (seed 2027 blocks)\nFresh session per step; repo inherited | Robot motifs = role metaphors (same model per run; F_t/P_t external)",
